      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarrs%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Passenger trains ran on the Southwest Branch of the Pennsylvania Railroad until the 1950s, after which tracks were abandoned by the 1980s.",
